# The initial deployment is an inert setup shell and needs no runtime secrets.
# Configure actual encrypted Worker secrets after setup; follow docs/cloudflare-deployment.md.
# RESEND_API_KEY: use the real sending key for your verified email provider account.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY: use the real server secret for the widget on your installation hostname.
# Keep secret values out of this example, Git, logs and deployment evidence.
# Optional Slack: configure SLACK_CLIENT_SECRET, SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET, and SLACK_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY.
# The Slack encryption key is an independent random 32-byte key encoded as base64; see docs/slack-integration.md.
